; C: commands added in Phase 221 (Which and SetDate: see paths/files)
FailAt 21
AddBuffers RAM:
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Lock RAM: ON
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Lock RAM: OFF
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Lock RAM: ON PASSKEY
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Lock
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Relabel nosuch: x
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Relabel
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
LoadResource LIBS:version.library
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
LoadResource nosuch
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
SetFont topaz 8
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
SetFont nosuchfont 8
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
SetKeyboard usa
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
SetKeyboard nosuch
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
SetPatch QUIET
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
IconX
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Echo "done"
